```

## Sequence-Diagramm

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Noyrax as Noyrax Plugin
    participant Docs as docs/ Directory
    participant Plugin as 5D Database Plugin
    participant DBs as SQLite-DBs
    participant MCP as Installierter MCP Server
    participant CLI as CLI-Tools (Fallback)
    participant AI as AI-Agent

    Noyrax->>Docs: Generate docs/
    AI->>Docs: Check if exists
    Docs-->>AI: docs/ exists
    AI->>Plugin: Run Ingestion
    Plugin->>DBs: Create SQLite-DBs
    alt Installierter MCP Server verfügbar
        AI->>MCP: Use MCP Server via MCP-Protokoll
